{"id":"word:hebrew:H6817","type":"word","title":"צָעַק","subtitle":"H6817 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to shriek ; (by implication) to proclaim (an assembly)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to צָעַק (H6817) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 55 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"צָעַק (tsâʻaq) means to shriek ; (by implication) to proclaim (an assembly) First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 20 39."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"צָעַק","transliteration":"tsâʻaq","pronunciation":"tsaw-ak'","strong":"H6817","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6817","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וַ/יִּצְעַ֥ק","וַ/יִּצְעֲק֥וּ","וַ/יִּצְעַ֣ק","וַ/יִּצְעֲק֣וּ","וַ/יִּצְעַ֤ק"],"morphs":[["HC/Vqw3ms",8],["HC/Vqw3mp",7],["HVqp3fs",4],["HVqi3ms",4],["HC/VNw3mp",3],["HVqp3cp",3],["HVqi3mp",3],["HC/VNw3ms",3],["HVqp3ms",2],["HC/Vqw1cp",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"to shriek ; (by implication) to proclaim (an assembly)","usage":"× at all, call together, cry (out), gather (selves) (together).","full":"H6817. tsaaq צָעַק verb cry, cry out, call (|| זָעַק ; Late Hebrew id. ; Arabic perhaps originally sound as thunder , compare thunderbolt , bellow (of bull)); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular ׳צ 1Kin 20:39 ; Lam 2:18 , 3 feminine singular צָֽעֲקָה Deut 22:24 +, etc.; Imperfect יִצְעַק Exod 23:22 +, etc.; Imperative feminine singular וְצַעֲקִי Jer 22:20 , וּצֳעָ֑קִי 22:20 ; feminine plural צְעַקְנָה 49:3 ; Infinitive absolute צָעֹק Exod 22:22 ; construct לִצְעֹק 2Kin 8:3 ; Participle feminine singular absolute צֹעֶ֫קֶת 8:5 ; masculine plural צֹעֲקִים Gen 4:10 ; Exod 5:8 ; &#8212; 1 cry, cry out , for help, usually with אֶל person; — a. unto man Gen 41:55 (E; + ל of thing), Num 11:3 (JE), 1Kin 20:39 ; 2Kin 6:26 ; 8:3 (+ אֶל of thing), 8:5 (+ עַל of thing); followed by אמר Exod 5:15 (J), 2Kin 4:1 and ( אֶל person omitted) Exod 5:8 (J), 2Kin 4:40 ; 6:5 . b. especially unto ׳י : Gen 4:10 ; Exod 8:8 ( + דְּבַר עַלֿ of thing), 14:10 , 15 ; 15:25 ; 17:4 ; 22:22 ( יִצְעַק צָעֹק ), 22:26 ; Num 12:13 ; 20:16 ; Josh 24:7 (all J E), Judg 4:3 ; 10:12 ; Deut 26:7 ; Isa 19:20 (+ מִמְּנֵי of thing), Lam 2:18 ; Neh 9:27 ; Psa 107:6 ; 107:28 ; ׳אֶלאֿ וְאֶצְעָ֑קָה קוֺלִי 77:2 , compare 34:18 ; with ׳לי 2Chr 13:14 : נֶגְדֶּ֑ךָ Psa 88:2 . c. cry unto ( אֶל ) idol Isa 46:7 . 2 absolute cry, cry out , in distress, need; — Gen 27:34 (J; with accusative of congnate meaning with verb), Deut 22:24 , 27 ; Isa 33:7 (|| בָּכָה ), 65:14 (|| הֵילִיל , opposed to רָנַן ; with מִן of thing), Jer 22:20 (twice in verse) (|| קוֺל נָתַן ), 49:3 (|| הֵילִיל ), Job 35:12 ; with object חָמָס 19:7 (|| אֲשַׁוַּע ). 3 make outcry, clamour , Isa 42:2 (+ קוֺלוֺ יַשְׁמִיעַ יִשָּׂא, ). Niph`al be summoned (i.e. to arms), absolute; Imperfect 3masculine singular וַיִּצָּעֵק Judg 7:23-24 , 12:1 , Songs 3 masculine plural וַיִּצָּֽעֲקוּ 10:17 ; 2Kin 3:21 , followed by שָׁאוּל אַחֲרֵי + accusative of location 1Sam 13:4 . Pi`el Participle מְצַעֵק cry aloud , in grief, 2Kin 2:12 . Hiph`il call together אֶליֿ ׳וַיַּצְעֵקאֶתהָֿעָם הַמִּצְמָּה 1Sam 10:17 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 20 39","keyReferences":["1Kgs 20 39","1Sam 10 17","1Sam 13 4","2Chr 13 14","2Kgs 2 12","2Kgs 3 21","2Kgs 4 1","2Kgs 4 40"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":55,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 20 39","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צָעַ֣ק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 10 17","book":"1Sam","chapter":10,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּצְעֵ֤ק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 13 4","book":"1Sam","chapter":13,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּצָּעֲק֥וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 13 14","book":"2Chr","chapte